<title>LITHUANIA: LATEST ECONOMIC INDICATORS - LITHUANIA.</title>
<headline>LATEST ECONOMIC INDICATORS - LITHUANIA.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's latest economic statistics,</p>
<p>in percentage changes on a month-on-month basis unless</p>
<p>otherwise indicated. * is updated this week.</p>
<p>Publication dates of new figures are approximate.</p>
<p>INDICATOR		  PERIOD    PCT     A YR AGO    LAST-NEXT</p>
<p>Inflation mo/mo*	 April	0.3	1.3     09/05-07/06</p>
<p>	    yr/yr*	 April	7.3	31.4    09/05-07/06</p>
<p>Trade balance (bln LTL) 1996     -4.5     -3.8</p>
<p>		  (mln LTL) Feb 97   -549     -252     06/05-06/06</p>
<p>			  Jan-Feb 97   -916     -422     06/05-06/06</p>
<p>GDP (bln LTL, preliminary)  96    31.1     23.8    22/04-n/a</p>
<p>				4Q  96    8.59     7.07    22/04-30/06</p>
<p>PPI			   March    -0.7	n/a     22/04-07/05</p>
<p>PPI (YR/YR)		 March     8.3	n/a     24/04-07/05</p>
<p>Unemployment*	     April     5.9	8.0     06/05-02/06</p>
